NordicTrail Gear Warranty Policy

NordicTrail Gear products include a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects.

The warranty covers broken zippers, faulty buckles, torn seams caused by manufacturing defects, and defective stitching.

The warranty does not cover normal wear and tear, accidental damage, misuse, lost items, or cosmetic damage from regular outdoor use.

Customers must provide proof of purchase when submitting a warranty claim.

Approved warranty claims may result in repair, replacement, or store credit.